#: scenario6:scenario6_C0D8ECB4_C3F3_4F7B_A234_A58E84B88C67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce8b4aaa1d0d17f441a7b6b1671493dee7a6415d0d37add86dfbf1c4811c4d31
#. default-sha256: ac3006aea92b1d2943f3adca8d6e6db9b398806a358fe865ede2aa0b0e32f3cd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C0D8ECB4_C3F3_4F7B_A234_A58E84B88C67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫Several hundred years after I was enslaved within the mansion,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫自从我被囚禁在馆里，⟪k:37⟫已经过了好几百年——"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DFCA190C_9381_49EB_AF34_7594F696866E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf72096dd01555e58bc7abab10f291a2d05d7a51729870fba2c48e11715c7729
#. default-sha256: 4483ea45f4bca2f59c1a11d40f0722aeffaacc372378a8ce1c4a4cfa3a869769
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DFCA190C_9381_49EB_AF34_7594F696866E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫something changed for the very first time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这里第一次出现了变化。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_A17834CC_C534_4890_9DF7_B42A8279E7D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ee3670a480bb239fae440d6e0ce8a0240ecd302550ed881097fc036ac705fc2
#. default-sha256: dda6bdf219720b33404f9cbb4255808d798b89ca46e2fe5b7bf482d8045a910a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_A17834CC_C534_4890_9DF7_B42A8279E7D2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sunlight, which I had not seen in all that time, shone in from outside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫没错……⟪k:1⟫令人怀念的阳光，⟪k:2⟫再次映入我的眼帘。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_B5740C44_6B5C_4BB8_A2B1_5BAB28C78E13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9097d19d45b43e8f9106b4141f373f8e410e6a6067f7b3422f975f964ab766b2
#. default-sha256: a8c78b4afdea7e3277816acdbf769953ea2b500a3db33a703d7c995051532f24
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_B5740C44_6B5C_4BB8_A2B1_5BAB28C78E13"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At first, I did not believe it was real. ⟪k:1⟫I thought it was a hallucination born of my "
"inner desires."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫最初，⟪k:1⟫我还不敢相信这是现实。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫我以为，这是我长久以来的愿望，让我看到的幻影。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_3B8290BF_A1FD_477C_9A25_BDDA5A48F678
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecd2d89d126b0b85ea034aa95fd34a6f2f2325aa3eefa1da42b8b671dcdc6ada
#. default-sha256: 09ea9268320fb790fb9caf25a67491e84c274f72917cae6a11677b2811e1310a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_3B8290BF_A1FD_477C_9A25_BDDA5A48F678"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I thought I must have completely lost it for my fantasies to have escaped my mind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫接着，我想……⟪k:1⟫「都能看到幻想的世界了，⟪k:2⟫看来我也疯了」。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_E0EFF0B0_F4EC_4C86_8C4E_09D63CF82B05
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f55fefafefc81edb9f89e435938f1d1c3804b46faf2a69ba901b8847f25a2fb3
#. default-sha256: 443c124ad9b3b0974d7e91a4dd6ad351f124d6a590eaa7848ade56562af8856b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E0EFF0B0_F4EC_4C86_8C4E_09D63CF82B05"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The time has come, Giselle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s time for you to get to work."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫好了，⟪k:2⟫吉赛儿。⟪k:3⟫你的工作时间到了。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_34F6CBFA_78F3_45B3_8F31_59CFF12DE53C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37d63b6acc7362ba515846e33ebd2ef2c603cc6d6574ca2b2b60d63b85c370a0
#. default-sha256: 219f8a9f8880245e18dc8e18fc84f14951bc1d4e9ff044403c0b341df46e5a86
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_34F6CBFA_78F3_45B3_8F31_59CFF12DE53C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Reveling in the sight of the outside was the last thing I should have been doing,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……看来，现在不是让我沉浸在感动里的时候。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫此时此刻，⟪k:3⟫这个瞬间——"

#: scenario6:scenario6_80F86752_F15F_4301_8AE2_C505E3FD8C04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54c473e946e5fb8164398ef13bf7752e708745fb20719bb87d788df2af44aa62
#. default-sha256: 3dbad6b5868c4af9c5eba8326205a4941db76f4c688e3a0102b41b06f5fcf80d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_80F86752_F15F_4301_8AE2_C505E3FD8C04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Work? What kind of work?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……工作，⟪k:1⟫指的是什么……？"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D477F6A9_07C6_4A3B_B245_F7D67FF2FA52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d61dea04176db99510d288c3aa64a736c095cd0739447c8bb5c3996bdcb2877
#. default-sha256: c110ba4f9ee2f4856fd3ff342bc7025b1eb415c94b9c62919bc17d3d53f48d79
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D477F6A9_07C6_4A3B_B245_F7D67FF2FA52"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I said, I need you to watch over the house,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and show your utmost hospitality to "
"those who show up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我有跟你说过吧？⟪k:1⟫你必须要守护着这间洋馆。⟪k:2⟫……有人来访的话，⟪k:3⟫要好好招待。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0836612C_FBFD_4359_8344_81C40AE9F202
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c3712aaa47155c65b29ac099ea8283a178773fe0283e2a1ecfa183ec24f93ab
#. default-sha256: 442544f8c3c605efdaf55a0221cbce5468584d9862c28a5752d9cb8efd7b7325
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0836612C_FBFD_4359_8344_81C40AE9F202"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is someone..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……有人来访……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_A469E825_CE1A_4518_B691_B78A80D10F5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b99309b3f7486d4b72551f993a1b5d4b2827bdd0f5ecbc375ecf8e070a9b0a2d
#. default-sha256: e133c54e160a4a824fede7cf3d7d89e72116065cf308e0b5ee7425467f810f9d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_A469E825_CE1A_4518_B691_B78A80D10F5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫H-⟪k:1⟫Hold on!⟪k:2⟫I-⟪k:3⟫I have no idea what I’m supposed to do..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——等、⟪k:1⟫等一下！⟪k:2⟫我、⟪k:3⟫我该，⟪k:4⟫怎么做……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ac1cf3b7dca3784b538d270567500f72a3cd72a57ec1dac56f01016da09a8b6
#. default-sha256: 6a64ee03e9d048c4dd3fc7b9ef57303389f1e0c248a2fb061fb76b7140b18b3e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do the same thing you have been doing—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫be a maid.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Convince the house’s "
"guests that this is a wonderful place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫跟之前一样，⟪k:1⟫继续做个佣人就好。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫这座洋馆是非常好的住所，⟪k:4⟫住起来非常舒适——"

#: scenario6:scenario6_7F6217C6_D418_4F30_BA21_F95C9C9613D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71ae9640d43c7df117d4deeba85d53e42c2919b35e6cafbb154b62370cbd723b
#. default-sha256: 904c200cabf3d5c0c5124b5fc2430ed7e6506bae7cf38aad3cfdde33ce606868
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7F6217C6_D418_4F30_BA21_F95C9C9613D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Make them enjoy their stay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你要让来访者产生这种想法。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_70266F3D_E042_48CB_AB84_325DB04F15EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0658d6fe4bd42be3996e26e607ba168d60d3e2ce45a59e6210ed3cbb432b5d3d
#. default-sha256: 5a90b05d8ca9ca3724e2c5c6e0b7704a749b56caa4ffa054e410e0403d5b0fbf
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_70266F3D_E042_48CB_AB84_325DB04F15EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(But will the door... ⟪k:1⟫open?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（大门——⟪k:1⟫能打开吗……？）"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C4E828DB_696C_4F5D_9A09_04597E774214
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f32f68ba06e2480a8ebe306cf22e9b0c266ce0fcb92916b64347b4ee33d7503
#. default-sha256: 75edd8876207ded4f8ec523942d9c81872957c989ce23a044ed7c1b866bca12f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C4E828DB_696C_4F5D_9A09_04597E774214"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For so long, the door had refused to budge.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For so long, light had forsaken "
"these halls.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫For so long, there had been no trace of life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫完全打不开的大门，⟪k:2⟫完全隔离光明的窗户，⟪k:3⟫毫无生物气息的馆。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D2037F95_74B5_451B_A296_F78BD0F5D9DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5cf8c88cf686cb7e1724ce3da92102ed063272ff2ef062c4d4510ea94659aebc
#. default-sha256: f70b1f1e5f77a701b010f0748877615b4061d66a6ac114e3177b7255adbbcd96
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D2037F95_74B5_451B_A296_F78BD0F5D9DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And now, all of that had been turned on its head."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所有一切，⟪k:1⟫皆被颠覆。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_48D2F6F0_DB1E_47E7_BCE8_38526208AA81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cffc05bf4f1fdb797a69cab839c5838f571791b39589f4bc1d7287fb2d424f86
#. default-sha256: 7d1bb1a46d9ab555bbe6a1b6e24c6badd65471e4734e2a6fb79fa45efc139a63
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_48D2F6F0_DB1E_47E7_BCE8_38526208AA81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was almost certainly a perfectly ordinary slice of nature.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Leaves and grass "
"rustled in the wind, flowers specked the earth,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这应该是平淡无奇的郊外景色吧。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫树木摇曳，⟪k:3⟫花朵也稀稀落落地四处绽放着……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D13D5DE9_195F_4D3C_81C4_5F28348226CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be10dab650a6a5156a34375fa79ad141f53819151238a97390a71bc2b4532589
#. default-sha256: 638589e7c4b604644559f3a2d4d0d02ca18e40674223f13d4b8169563324dd05
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D13D5DE9_195F_4D3C_81C4_5F28348226CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and in the distance was a city I didn’t recognize."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫远方，⟪k:1⟫能望见我不熟悉的小镇。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_74392373_5663_4CF6_84BF_B3306B93FFFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5fb6be4f4bc2cc7b46581fc0b62bfb94e15b29d62bc57dcbe1f500a146d7275
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_74392373_5663_4CF6_84BF_B3306B93FFFC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9AABB09C_CF88_4A18_A3CA_56C00600AA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 690721b27fd3936398e98091fb1060f12f04e67050b84761908efd4ff80dfabf
#. default-sha256: d773b8d769b3a22a26f3b6fbd69b7a92659f4490f3ef19e8e6ca10809987120e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9AABB09C_CF88_4A18_A3CA_56C00600AA69"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As I was standing there idly before the entrance, a carriage rolled up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我在大门口呆站了片刻，⟪k:2⟫只见一辆马车慢慢驶来。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F3B45874_CAF6_4E5B_AE11_85DD6996100F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5fb6be4f4bc2cc7b46581fc0b62bfb94e15b29d62bc57dcbe1f500a146d7275
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F3B45874_CAF6_4E5B_AE11_85DD6996100F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9724AECD_04EF_42BA_A8BE_8767E042080F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b8b049dbe796add23bdb53b732b1b61ee5b2b407564b532346d09e95986a692
#. default-sha256: 55c5a5e344b55b35f814230b78e031bb7c2160aed4e40f2c9603919b5ee58bc0
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9724AECD_04EF_42BA_A8BE_8767E042080F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mm? And who might you be, young lady?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That outfit..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫嗯？⟪k:1⟫你……是谁啊？⟪k:2⟫还有，⟪k:3⟫你那身打扮……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2BA96708_D781_43B5_984B_CAB87143E16E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78d576fe30aac452b71c553257f059d441c3ab0bb8f04dbac147f672f53e86de
#. default-sha256: 29cf1856aa0cf1c812362863d20085dfc3bb4f677689b6ae780817a7db3ffced
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2BA96708_D781_43B5_984B_CAB87143E16E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Could the mansion... ⟪k:1⟫have moved somewhere far, far away...?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（难道这座洋馆转移到了很远的地方吗……）"

#: scenario6:scenario6_3368DB51_6FE4_4865_9B98_E0C8669209D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 568cbc1b65efda9fbfd14088eadc8c38acce303a12fb261150840984098c3b0d
#. default-sha256: 1fc8eff48c00a48e8afbf719c62a1a161a6b7df08e4f83da80d5234a8483bf02
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_3368DB51_6FE4_4865_9B98_E0C8669209D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Naturally, I had no idea how such a thing was possible."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为什么会发生这种事情，⟪k:1⟫我完全无法理解。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D43BC81C_DC3C_4882_B12A_C944953139E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1778d5f4f604f65488507e498f93a9bdb21786f049ab78a6642ed48d0961d7e0
#. default-sha256: 5f93fed6f305549dc48e6e079c4bd75abe71d4af42fff7b2eb76f192d7f0efb2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D43BC81C_DC3C_4882_B12A_C944953139E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My immediate mission was to overcome the language barrier."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫总之，眼下的问题是——「如何突破语言交流的障碍」，⟪k:1⟫这才是最关键的。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_8FA79258_DF70_48F7_9CB8_87476012B44C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fab2fa928bf1e035312087060e12d4f52cee4779aba69f7b80029828befd44f
#. default-sha256: 338a557c434c765ee68e43a1e78fc4d96497b7a84d3834d3559f561a511bcf82
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8FA79258_DF70_48F7_9CB8_87476012B44C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Servant? ⟪k:1⟫Can’t say I remember asking for a ⟪k:2⟫lady⟪k:3⟫ servant,⟪k:4⟫but eh, I "
